  "content": "<section>\n<div>\n<p>Simple Missiles 是一個新增多種飛彈的模組，你可以將飛彈發射到任何座標。模組仍在開發中，因此許多內容將會新增、修改或移除。</p>\n<p><strong>TNT 飛彈</strong></p>\n<p>一種簡單的彈道飛彈，爆炸威力與普通 TNT 相當。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d60e17d09f1c8b68067c718487d499e085c5b97b.png\" alt=\"TNT 飛彈\" width=\"131\" height=\"163\"></p>\n<p><strong>凝固汽油彈飛彈</strong></p>\n<p>嗯，就是凝固汽油彈。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/abb80c144327172e630c8308c6bc13d8b652a700.png\" alt=\"凝固汽油彈飛彈\" width=\"141\" height=\"176\"></p>\n<p><strong>集束飛彈</strong></p>\n<p>爆炸時會釋放出大量小型炸彈的炸彈。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aeaf7c660da1c476a6c7e45b551c07b593671f32.png\" alt=\"集束飛彈\" width=\"151\" height=\"188\"></p>\n<p><strong>電磁脈衝飛彈<br></strong>能夠破壞紅石及模組電子設備的飛彈。<strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1127659/description_5688636e-7af0-4313-a359-700364112033.png\" alt=\"電磁脈衝飛彈\" width=\"118\" height=\"221\"><br><br><br>歐米茄飛彈</strong><br>最強大的飛彈（會造成遊戲卡頓！）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/52466049c6e8301ac1fa4d5820192fe32e33ad88.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"246\"></p>\n<p><br><br>加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/crhq3Fny6v\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9;text-decoration:underline\">Discord 伺服器</span></span></a>！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>看看我的其他模組</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-mines\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1127659/description_b6a001ce-3b10-4540-822a-4ac2828b976e.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meme-death-sounds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1127659/description_c0c6d5db-88c2-4c88-87ea-97038521f6f8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glaidens-gas-masks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1127659/description_ff7eb950-d89f-4b55-bcd1-b4022ec8a223.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glaidens-forgotten-items-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1127659/description_2f5581f4-5b30-48fe-a3ed-f38aa9f5c3d6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villagers-drop-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1109/338/638660033928011266.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n</div>\n</section>",
